OL,3,AParades Commission says Orange Order
OL,4,ADrumcree parade can go ahead
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Parades Commission has ruled that
OL,7,Fan Orange Order parade at Drumcree can
OL,8,Fgo ahead
OL,10,FA number of conditions including the
OL,11,Fnumber of participants and the timing
OL,12,Fof the parade has been put in place
OL,14,FThe Parades Commission had been
OL,15,Fdeliberating on whether the parade
OL,16,Fwould be allowed along the mainly
OL,17,Fnationalist Garvaghy Road
OL,19,FUnionist politicians urged the
OL,20,Ffive-person commission to permit
OL,21,FSunday's march
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
